WEBVTT

00:00:02.168 --> 00:00:06.571
Now, a miracle is about to be
created upon this planet.

00:00:09.876 --> 00:00:11.605
One hot summer day...

00:00:14.180 --> 00:00:15.841
...I died.

00:00:17.517 --> 00:00:19.212
Hovering between life and death...

00:00:19.386 --> 00:00:22.122
...as I watched life on this planet
facing its demise...

00:00:22.122 --> 00:00:24.147
...he spoke to me.

00:00:24.924 --> 00:00:27.994
If you are able to fight the Raaja...

00:00:27.994 --> 00:00:30.997
...purge this planet of them,
and lead the way to the future...

00:00:30.997 --> 00:00:33.795
...I will save your life
this one time.

00:00:37.170 --> 00:00:39.039
Reactors 1, 2, and 3.
Core temperatures decreasing.

00:00:39.039 --> 00:00:41.107
Confirming shut down of reactor.

00:00:41.107 --> 00:00:44.508
Reactor 4 malfunction in the
operation of the control rods.

00:00:44.944 --> 00:00:46.846
The reactor will not shut down!

00:00:46.846 --> 00:00:49.149
The control rods won't move?!

00:00:49.149 --> 00:00:52.452
We must issue an order
to evacuate the surrounding area.

00:00:52.452 --> 00:00:53.486
Quiet.

00:00:53.486 --> 00:00:55.555
There are a few things we can try.

00:00:55.555 --> 00:00:57.357
Switch the system over to manual.

00:00:57.357 --> 00:00:59.759
Has the ECCS been activated yet?

00:00:59.759 --> 00:01:02.922
Check the emergency route to the
safety valves of the reactor core!

00:01:03.296 --> 00:01:04.431
Juna!

00:01:04.431 --> 00:01:06.331
Tokio!

00:01:12.105 --> 00:01:13.807
Confirming Earth Sympathy Reaction!

00:01:13.807 --> 00:01:15.842
That girl couldn't be...

00:01:15.842 --> 00:01:17.434
...the Avatar of Time.

00:01:25.585 --> 00:01:30.648
Earth Maiden Arjuna

00:01:33.426 --> 00:01:38.022
Episode 2: The Blue Light

00:01:38.331 --> 00:01:42.563
Dogasaki Nuclear Power Plant

00:01:44.571 --> 00:01:47.165
Hey, what are you doing here?

00:01:51.010 --> 00:01:52.944
What are YOU doing here?

00:01:54.414 --> 00:01:57.611
I was worried about you, so I...

00:02:02.789 --> 00:02:04.450
H-Hey...

00:02:06.259 --> 00:02:08.124
- Hey, you freak.
- Huh?!

00:02:09.162 --> 00:02:11.323
This is no time to be
messing around!

00:02:11.831 --> 00:02:13.299
Wh-What're you...

00:02:13.299 --> 00:02:14.901
Where are you watching from?

00:02:14.901 --> 00:02:17.267
A Raaja's right in front of you,
you know.

00:02:17.704 --> 00:02:18.471
That's right!

00:02:18.471 --> 00:02:20.462
Hey, who are you talking to?

00:02:23.376 --> 00:02:24.744
Oh, no!

00:02:24.744 --> 00:02:27.611
What...
What am I supposed to do?

00:02:30.383 --> 00:02:32.018
A holy bow that brings light...

00:02:32.018 --> 00:02:35.321
...and purges the filthy demons.

00:02:35.321 --> 00:02:36.623
It is Gan Deeva.

00:02:36.623 --> 00:02:38.725
Gan Deeva...?

00:02:38.725 --> 00:02:41.194
Do you have the ability to use it?

00:02:41.194 --> 00:02:42.061
Wha...?!

00:02:42.061 --> 00:02:45.360
I just have to do it, right?!
Just do it, right?!

00:02:54.674 --> 00:02:56.476
This is really heavy.

00:02:56.476 --> 00:02:58.344
H-Hey...

00:02:58.344 --> 00:03:01.006
Were you hit in the head?

00:03:07.453 --> 00:03:10.388
There's no way you can
take Chris' place.

00:03:18.498 --> 00:03:19.226
No way...!

00:03:33.446 --> 00:03:34.037
Screw up.

00:03:39.485 --> 00:03:40.349
No!

00:03:40.887 --> 00:03:42.787
No!

00:03:56.970 --> 00:03:58.538
Zero time response confirmed!

00:03:58.538 --> 00:04:00.373
Space-time resonance
fluctuating wildly!

00:04:00.373 --> 00:04:01.307
The Omega pattern!

00:04:01.307 --> 00:04:02.842
She couldn't possibly...

00:04:02.842 --> 00:04:05.709
...be able to summon
Ashura already?!

00:04:15.655 --> 00:04:17.557
Stay calm! Put out the fires!

00:04:17.557 --> 00:04:19.525
We must limit the damage!

00:04:19.525 --> 00:04:22.619
This is bad.
At this rate, the reactor core will...

00:04:25.098 --> 00:04:26.132
The fool.

00:04:26.132 --> 00:04:28.401
She's been taken over by fear.

00:04:28.401 --> 00:04:30.770
Descend immediately.
I'll go myself.

00:04:30.770 --> 00:04:32.965
- No! It's too dangerous!
- Just do it!

00:04:33.239 --> 00:04:34.263
All right.

00:04:34.574 --> 00:04:36.599
Bring the helicopter to the
battle area immediately.

00:04:39.646 --> 00:04:41.113
H-Hey, Juna...?

00:05:09.442 --> 00:05:10.534
H-Hey...

00:05:15.615 --> 00:05:17.014
What're you doing?!

00:05:34.067 --> 00:05:36.235
Primary cooling system is leaking!

00:05:36.235 --> 00:05:38.863
And the ECCS is
no longer operable.

00:05:39.138 --> 00:05:41.074
Malfunction in the pressure pipes.

00:05:41.074 --> 00:05:43.176
The injection system
will not function.

00:05:43.176 --> 00:05:44.711
Where's the trouble in the pipes?

00:05:44.711 --> 00:05:48.381
We can't determine that since
the sensors have been damaged.

00:05:48.381 --> 00:05:49.541
What?!

00:05:59.826 --> 00:06:02.228
Reactor No. 4.
Core temperature increasing.

00:06:02.228 --> 00:06:05.129
There will be a meltdown
in 20 minutes.

00:06:12.939 --> 00:06:16.376
Issue an evacuation order
to all personnel...

00:06:16.376 --> 00:06:18.344
...and residents
in the surrounding area.

00:06:19.545 --> 00:06:21.240
But, Chief...

00:06:21.447 --> 00:06:24.245
We cannot let this get any worse.

00:06:29.222 --> 00:06:30.655
Yes, sir.

00:06:32.859 --> 00:06:34.349
Are you going to run away?

00:06:34.827 --> 00:06:36.886
Now, you people as well!

00:06:43.736 --> 00:06:45.037
Chris?

00:06:45.037 --> 00:06:46.129
Look.

00:06:47.039 --> 00:06:48.408
What is that?

00:06:48.408 --> 00:06:50.276
The divine protector of time,
Ashura.

00:06:50.276 --> 00:06:52.403
A servant who protects you.

00:06:52.612 --> 00:06:54.147
Why did you summon Ashura?

00:06:54.147 --> 00:06:56.682
What?! I summoned it?

00:06:56.682 --> 00:06:57.884
That's right.

00:06:57.884 --> 00:06:59.215
But...

00:06:59.419 --> 00:07:03.356
That must be to fight against...

00:07:03.356 --> 00:07:04.424
Don't be stupid.

00:07:04.424 --> 00:07:06.551
- Who told you to fight?
- Huh?

00:07:07.260 --> 00:07:08.728
What're you talking about?

00:07:08.728 --> 00:07:10.963
You're the one who told me
to fight the monster.

00:07:10.963 --> 00:07:13.090
I never told you to fight.

00:07:13.766 --> 00:07:14.994
You're kidding.

00:07:15.101 --> 00:07:18.337
If you are able to fight the Raaja...

00:07:18.337 --> 00:07:21.707
...purge this planet of them,
and lead the way to the future...

00:07:21.707 --> 00:07:24.577
...I will save your life
this one time.

00:07:24.577 --> 00:07:27.546
That's why...
That's why I fought.

00:07:28.815 --> 00:07:30.116
You fool.

00:07:30.116 --> 00:07:32.641
Was that the only way
you understood it?

00:07:33.986 --> 00:07:36.189
You were unable to understand...

00:07:36.189 --> 00:07:39.420
...the meaning of words
for what they are.

00:07:39.892 --> 00:07:41.291
I was really scared.

00:07:42.361 --> 00:07:44.022
So I fought!

00:08:08.988 --> 00:08:10.353
The reactor building!

00:08:13.326 --> 00:08:15.658
Has anyone seen Chief Dojima?!

00:08:16.996 --> 00:08:18.088
Don't tell me...!

00:08:26.138 --> 00:08:29.596
I fought as hard as I could.

00:08:30.810 --> 00:08:33.677
Oh dear. You sure are trouble.

00:08:35.214 --> 00:08:36.272
H-Hey...

00:08:37.650 --> 00:08:39.413
That Chris...

00:09:06.812 --> 00:09:08.939
- Will you cut that out?!
- Tokio...

00:09:09.382 --> 00:09:10.815
You...

00:09:13.853 --> 00:09:15.844
What's going on here, anyway?!

00:09:15.955 --> 00:09:17.946
Tell me what the heck's going on!

00:09:18.057 --> 00:09:20.548
Well, it's just that...

00:09:21.360 --> 00:09:22.156
The fool.

00:09:23.596 --> 00:09:25.531
It's not over yet.

00:09:25.531 --> 00:09:28.227
What? It's not over yet?

00:09:28.301 --> 00:09:28.901
No Unauthorized Entry

00:09:28.901 --> 00:09:30.095
No Unauthorized Entry

00:09:30.303 --> 00:09:31.827
This isn't the end yet.

00:09:37.577 --> 00:09:40.413
No! I want to stay here!

00:09:40.413 --> 00:09:42.615
If neither I nor Teresa return...

00:09:42.615 --> 00:09:46.786
...we'll need someone
who can train her properly.

00:09:46.786 --> 00:09:48.521
That's impossible!

00:09:48.521 --> 00:09:50.856
She's a total coward!

00:09:50.856 --> 00:09:54.292
How could an ugly girl like that
take your place anyway?!

00:10:00.166 --> 00:10:03.829
What're you doing to me?!
Let me go! Let go!

00:10:14.080 --> 00:10:16.310
No, Chris!

00:10:32.765 --> 00:10:33.959
Chris...

00:10:44.944 --> 00:10:50.075
Earth Maiden Arjuna

00:10:51.651 --> 00:10:53.085
Brainwaves unstable.

00:10:53.085 --> 00:10:56.889
We can only recognize one phase
of the Earth Sympathy wave.

00:10:56.889 --> 00:10:57.590
I'll put up the simulation
based on the weather data.

00:10:57.590 --> 00:10:59.892
I'll put up the simulation
based on the weather data.

00:10:59.892 --> 00:11:01.494
Earth Safety Institute
S. E. E. D. Far Eastern Headquarters

00:11:01.494 --> 00:11:02.586
Earth Safety Institute
S. E. E. D. Far Eastern Headquarters

00:11:03.129 --> 00:11:05.898
...all of the Kansai region
will be affected.

00:11:05.898 --> 00:11:09.129
Maybe it was too much for a
highschool girl to handle.

00:11:11.404 --> 00:11:14.340
When it comes, the capital
of a thousand years...

00:11:14.340 --> 00:11:17.776
...will become a city
where nobody can live.

00:11:25.918 --> 00:11:28.254
What a disaster.

00:11:28.254 --> 00:11:30.347
These safety devices are crap...

00:11:37.396 --> 00:11:40.593
Unfortunately,
it looks like I win the bet.

00:11:55.881 --> 00:11:57.583
What's the matter, Chris?

00:11:57.583 --> 00:11:59.414
Did something happen to you?

00:12:04.390 --> 00:12:07.393
A fragment of the Raaja came after me.

00:12:07.393 --> 00:12:08.724
No...

00:12:09.595 --> 00:12:10.963
It's all your fault!

00:12:10.963 --> 00:12:12.498
You're the Avatar of Time...

00:12:12.498 --> 00:12:14.734
...but you can't do anything!

00:12:14.734 --> 00:12:17.203
What am I supposed to do?

00:12:17.203 --> 00:12:19.405
Yeah!
This has nothing to do with us!

00:12:19.405 --> 00:12:21.464
Keep your mouth shut, Kid!

00:12:21.607 --> 00:12:22.541
Kid?!

00:12:22.541 --> 00:12:23.509
That's right.

00:12:23.509 --> 00:12:25.344
You don't understand anything.

00:12:25.344 --> 00:12:26.145
Listen...

00:12:26.145 --> 00:12:30.809
...if that blows up, even the city
you live in will be in danger.

00:12:31.183 --> 00:12:32.377
The city...

00:12:35.955 --> 00:12:39.024
You only worry if
it has to do with you.

00:12:39.024 --> 00:12:41.594
If it doesn't, then you
couldn't care less.

00:12:41.594 --> 00:12:42.891
Well...

00:12:44.463 --> 00:12:46.165
You should be able to see it.

00:12:46.165 --> 00:12:48.534
I can only hear voices...

00:12:48.534 --> 00:12:50.970
...if you really
are the Avatar of Time...

00:12:50.970 --> 00:12:53.165
...you should see with your spirit.

00:12:57.176 --> 00:12:59.311
Do you realize how desperately...

00:12:59.311 --> 00:13:02.644
...Chris and Teresa are
working to save everyone?

00:13:07.353 --> 00:13:09.082
Don't move.

00:13:11.557 --> 00:13:13.292
This incredible steam...

00:13:13.292 --> 00:13:17.388
It reminds me of the steam trains
I saw as a child.

00:13:18.130 --> 00:13:21.167
Ever since I first saw that
big chunk of steel...

00:13:21.167 --> 00:13:23.335
...blowing clouds of steam...

00:13:23.335 --> 00:13:26.702
...and charging across
the fields of snow...

00:13:27.273 --> 00:13:32.267
...I knew I wanted to build
a machine like that one day.

00:13:35.915 --> 00:13:39.418
But a nuclear reactor has
too many risks.

00:13:39.418 --> 00:13:41.387
Besides, once you include the costs...

00:13:41.387 --> 00:13:43.856
...of construction and waste...

00:13:43.856 --> 00:13:46.125
...it's no longer
economically viable.

00:13:46.125 --> 00:13:49.361
Many countries have either
cancelled construction...

00:13:49.361 --> 00:13:51.330
...or closed down
nuclear power plants.

00:13:51.330 --> 00:13:53.924
You don't have to tell me that.

00:13:55.534 --> 00:13:57.102
Fifteen years ago...

00:13:57.102 --> 00:13:59.371
Just fifteen years ago...

00:13:59.371 --> 00:14:01.507
...before the
economic bubble burst.

00:14:01.507 --> 00:14:06.206
We had to keep up with the power
demand of those heady times.

00:14:06.912 --> 00:14:10.075
But we can eliminate
all the nuclear power plants...

00:14:10.916 --> 00:14:13.118
And do without air conditioning...

00:14:13.118 --> 00:14:15.221
...for two weeks in mid summer.

00:14:15.221 --> 00:14:19.624
No. We're not even able to do that.

00:14:21.560 --> 00:14:23.329
That's why...

00:14:23.329 --> 00:14:26.662
...we have to ensure safety,
at the very least.

00:14:40.446 --> 00:14:41.743
Everyone...

00:14:49.955 --> 00:14:51.457
I'm going.

00:14:51.457 --> 00:14:53.626
I'm going to try again.

00:14:53.626 --> 00:14:54.793
H-Hey!

00:14:54.793 --> 00:14:56.061
Are you serious?

00:14:56.061 --> 00:14:57.722
Keep quiet, kid.

00:14:58.264 --> 00:15:00.255
You said it.

00:15:04.436 --> 00:15:06.563
There's no end to this!

00:15:09.008 --> 00:15:10.709
All right!

00:15:10.709 --> 00:15:11.698
Juna!

00:15:15.581 --> 00:15:18.117
The wind! The light!

00:15:18.117 --> 00:15:19.448
The land!

00:15:26.058 --> 00:15:27.159
Juna!

00:15:27.159 --> 00:15:28.285
Hey, girl!

00:15:28.494 --> 00:15:31.130
Get inside! I'll take care of this!

00:15:31.130 --> 00:15:32.498
Are you sure?

00:15:32.498 --> 00:15:34.133
If you lose control of Ashura...

00:15:34.133 --> 00:15:35.234
...this place will be...

00:15:35.234 --> 00:15:37.532
It's better than doing nothing!

00:15:38.003 --> 00:15:39.834
Don't miss this time.

00:15:54.353 --> 00:15:55.788
Come on! Come on!

00:15:55.788 --> 00:15:57.449
What're you doing?!

00:15:59.425 --> 00:16:01.086
I'm over here!

00:16:26.151 --> 00:16:28.220
Darn! This isn't the one either!

00:16:28.220 --> 00:16:30.688
Too bad. Where to next?

00:16:33.959 --> 00:16:35.358
Chris!

00:16:35.561 --> 00:16:37.085
Did you find it?

00:16:41.667 --> 00:16:43.965
What the hell is that?

00:16:44.503 --> 00:16:47.706
One of my people has
found the malfunction.

00:16:47.706 --> 00:16:49.105
What?

00:16:55.581 --> 00:16:56.148
Let's go.

00:16:56.148 --> 00:16:57.376
But...

00:16:58.083 --> 00:17:00.586
You must keep what you saw
to yourself.

00:17:00.586 --> 00:17:01.245
Besides...

00:17:01.453 --> 00:17:04.857
...people wouldn't believe you,
even if you did tell them.

00:17:04.857 --> 00:17:06.692
Who are you people, anyway?

00:17:06.692 --> 00:17:08.557
Now, hang on tight!

00:17:13.599 --> 00:17:15.089
Don't be afraid.

00:17:17.102 --> 00:17:18.504
Don't be afraid...

00:17:18.504 --> 00:17:21.206
...even if your body were
to be ripped apart.

00:17:21.206 --> 00:17:22.503
What?

00:17:29.882 --> 00:17:31.316
That's right.

00:17:31.316 --> 00:17:34.717
You must feel the present.

00:17:55.374 --> 00:17:56.375
One...

00:17:56.375 --> 00:18:00.641
The body effortlessly permeates
through all of the universe.

00:18:04.083 --> 00:18:05.384
Two...

00:18:05.384 --> 00:18:09.184
Compose oneself,
and exhale onto the earth.

00:18:15.527 --> 00:18:16.595
You all right?

00:18:16.595 --> 00:18:18.363
Now, let's hurry up!

00:18:18.363 --> 00:18:19.565
Three...

00:18:19.565 --> 00:18:23.001
Look far,
far beyond the limitless...

00:18:23.001 --> 00:18:24.332
Juna...

00:18:25.637 --> 00:18:26.695
It's done!

00:18:33.145 --> 00:18:34.446
Four...

00:18:34.446 --> 00:18:36.281
It's not to shoot the target.

00:18:36.281 --> 00:18:37.873
But rather to become one...

00:18:40.853 --> 00:18:43.378
- We somehow made it in time.
- Yes.

00:18:44.590 --> 00:18:46.114
- What's that?!
- Can't be!

00:18:47.893 --> 00:18:50.453
Become one with the target.

00:18:51.029 --> 00:18:51.996
Become one!

00:18:56.635 --> 00:18:57.602
Too late!

00:18:57.936 --> 00:18:59.096
Juna!

00:19:13.152 --> 00:19:15.347
What is this?

00:19:20.726 --> 00:19:23.061
Was the Raaja born...

00:19:23.061 --> 00:19:25.222
...from the injured Earth?

00:19:32.271 --> 00:19:36.139
You must have suffered, too.

00:19:58.697 --> 00:19:59.891
What is this?!

00:20:00.499 --> 00:20:02.057
Have we been saved?

00:20:15.280 --> 00:20:16.907
Juna...

00:20:28.994 --> 00:20:32.430
Were you the one that saved me?

00:20:33.031 --> 00:20:34.692
That was quite perilous.

00:20:40.005 --> 00:20:42.674
Your body is too filthy.

00:20:42.674 --> 00:20:43.766
Huh?

00:20:44.243 --> 00:20:46.612
That filth created your fear...

00:20:46.612 --> 00:20:49.240
...and made you blind to the truth.

00:20:50.148 --> 00:20:51.984
What do you mean?

00:20:51.984 --> 00:20:55.454
You must cleanse that filth.

00:20:55.454 --> 00:20:56.682
What?

00:21:00.025 --> 00:21:04.462
Arjuna

00:21:14.473 --> 00:21:20.979
Yesterday's rains

00:21:20.979 --> 00:21:25.973
Brought cold stars to the eastern city

00:21:26.785 --> 00:21:33.292
Quietly and sadly

00:21:33.292 --> 00:21:39.822
You hum my favorite song

00:21:41.366 --> 00:21:45.737
I have to go, or no one will save

00:21:45.737 --> 00:21:49.207
The boy who wandered

00:21:49.207 --> 00:21:53.541
Into the deep darkness

00:21:53.779 --> 00:21:58.250
With love alone, I will go

00:21:58.250 --> 00:22:01.320
No matter where you are

00:22:01.320 --> 00:22:06.024
I will go running straight to you

00:22:06.024 --> 00:22:10.962
So, in a loud voice

00:22:10.962 --> 00:22:19.870
Call out my name again and again
